      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61ba21ab7b7f18766e50ad71|full_name}\n\nthats not what \"IsAvatarOwner\" is for, or would be.\n\nheres an example:\n\nIsLocal would send true if you are wearing the avatar locally.\n\nIsAvatarOwner would send true *only* if you are the avatar creator, wearing the avatar.\n\nthe difference between the two is *Anyone* can activate IsLocal if they are wearing the avatar, locally.\n\nwhile IsAvatarOwner would make it so implementing special interactions on public avatars if they are the creator, possible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
